# CorePrivatePremo (29013, level 45, no skills of its own), every draw 0: a character more than 8 levels
# above it (60 against 53) that hits it is cursed (4515-1) at weight 1000000, a mate of level 40
# that hits it is not, and a level 60 caster of Ultimate Debuff (4694) on a monster beside it is
# muted (4215-1) instead of the base see-spell reaction. The template lists both skills (the
# shipped one lists neither) so the fixture loads them for the cast desires.
character Hunter 60
skill 4694 1
roll player 0
random always 0
member Mate 40 -100 0 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.CorePrivatePremo
npc premo 29013 Monster 150 0 0 level 45 walks skill DEBUFF1 4515 1 skill DEBUFF2 4215 1
npc wolf 20120 Monster 100 0 0

hit premo 10 by Mate
  desires premo -
hit premo 10
  desires premo cast(player,4515:1,move)=1000000
cast wolf 4694
  S MagicSkillUse caster=player target=wolf skill=4694-1 hit=0 reuse=0 success=0
  S SystemMessage id=46 4:4694,1
  desires premo cast(player,4515:1,move)=1000000 cast(player,4215:1,move)=1000000
